      "text": "What if.... Artix was trapped in a Pac-Man-esque dungeon? This &quot;byte-sized&quot; adventure features a ghost-filled maze of rooms. Find your battle axe and battle your way to the end. Oh, and be sure to pick up power runes. They will turn the ghosts blue so you can hit them :D. Reach the end screen of this short but challenging game for ultimate bragging rights."
